 "notes": "Basic: one isosceles right triangle, right-angle vertex and orientation vary. Constructed by rotating the leg vector 90 degrees, so legs equal and hypotenuse squared is twice a leg squared. Non-degenerate since p>=1. Model: bk-try-1."
